---
// 「40 歲，是一個分水嶺」開場區塊：文字版首頁與健康島文字版共用（3D 健康島的開場畫面寫在 HealthIsland.astro，文案保持一致）。
import ParentAgeCalc from './ParentAgeCalc.astro';
import { STATIONS } from '../utils/categories';
---
<section class="forty" aria-labelledby="fortyT">
  <div class="forty-in">
    <p class="forty-eye">男性慢老</p>
    <h2 id="fortyT">40 歲，是一個分水嶺。</h2>
    <p>工作穩了，存了一些錢，也買了一些股票。錢，你懂得配置。<b>那你的身體，有沒有配置？</b></p>
    <p>再算一件事：你 60 歲的時候，爸媽幾歲？</p>
    <ParentAgeCalc />
    <p>打開朋友圈，有人開始晨跑、游泳，有人報名了全馬。</p>
    <h3>你在意的是什麼？</h3>
    <div class="forty-st">
      {STATIONS.map((s) => (
        <a href={`/knowledge/?cat=${s.slug}`} style={`--c:${s.color}`}><b>{s.n}</b>{s.label}</a>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="forty-more"><a href="/sample/">找 Jason 之後會拿到什麼？看一份起點整理示例 →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .forty { padding: 3rem 16px; background: #fffaf5; border-top: 1px solid #f1e3d6; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1e3d6; }
  .forty-in { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .forty-eye { font: 600 .75rem 'DM Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .12em; color: #db6a41; margin: 0 0 .5rem; }
  .forty h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.2rem); line-height: 1.3; margin: 0 0 1rem; color: #211d1d; }
  .forty p { font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #3a3330; margin: 0 0 .6rem; }
  .forty h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 1.2rem 0 .7rem; color: #211d1d; }
  .forty-st { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: .5rem; }
  .forty-st a { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; min-height: 46px; padding: .55rem .8rem; border-radius: 12px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(33,29,29,.1); border-left: 5px solid var(--c); color: #211d1d; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
  .forty-st a b { font: 700 .75rem 'DM Mono', monospace; color: #8a7a6e; }
  .forty-st a:hover { background: #fcea8b; }
  .forty-more { margin-top: 1.2rem !important; }
  .forty-more a { color: #1a8c82; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .forty-st { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
</style>
